  "event.sequia.headline": "Drought in the Valley: vegetables, fruits and grains go up.",
  "event.sequia.letter": "DROUGHT IN THE VALLEY^Weeks without rain are hurting the region's crops. Zuzu City buyers pay more for vegetables, fruits and grains while the shortage lasts.^Farmers who can water have an opportunity.",
